# 行尾策略: 文本文件在仓库与工作区统一使用 LF。
# 该设置优先级高于 core.autocrlf(Windows 上 Git 安装默认 true),
# 因此可消除 "LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it" 提示,
# 并保证各平台检出的行尾一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件: 不做行尾转换, 也不参与文本 diff/merge
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
